msgid ""
"Optional. Give it your own names break (.xsq) and the themed versions are "
"made from it: same music, same timing, same singing faces, just new colors "
"and effects. Leave it empty and Marquee makes everything from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Give it your own names break (.xsq) and the themed versions are "
"made from it: same music, same timing, same singing faces, just new colours "
"and effects. Leave it empty and Marquee makes everything from scratch."

msgid ""
"How the AI helps: Marquee reads your layout (step 1) here in your browser "
"and tells the AI only your prop names and what kind each is (trees, arches, "
"rooflines…). The AI picks the colors and an effect for each kind; Marquee "
"then writes the sequence from your layout. Your layout file itself never "
"leaves your computer."
msgstr ""
"How the AI helps: Marquee reads your layout (step 1) here in your browser "
"and tells the AI only your prop names and what kind each is (trees, arches, "
"rooflines…). The AI picks the colours and an effect for each kind; Marquee "
"then writes the sequence from your layout. Your layout file itself never "
"leaves your computer."

msgid "Tonight’s show is canceled"
msgstr "Tonight’s show is cancelled"

msgid "Coloring pages"
msgstr "Colouring pages"

msgid "Favorite song voting"
msgstr "Favourite song voting"

msgid "Classic: warm multicolor twinkle"
msgstr "Classic: warm multicolour twinkle"

msgid "Rainbow: every color, moving"
msgstr "Rainbow: every colour, moving"

msgid ""
"Each card on the right is what kids see when they pick. Without a picture "
"it’s a little animated house in that theme’s colors; add a picture (a photo "
"of your house during that sequence works great) to use it instead."
msgstr ""
"Each card on the right is what kids see when they pick. Without a picture "
"it’s a little animated house in that theme’s colours; add a picture (a photo"
" of your house during that sequence works great) to use it instead."

msgid ""
"No. Without one, kids see a little animated picture of a lit-up house in "
"that theme’s colors (pick the look under each theme). A photo or short clip "
"of your own house during that sequence is even better."
msgstr ""
"No. Without one, kids see a little animated picture of a lit-up house in "
"that theme’s colours (pick the look under each theme). A photo or short clip"
" of your own house during that sequence is even better."

msgid "Also post “Show canceled tonight” on %s"
msgstr "Also post “Show cancelled tonight” on %s"

msgid ""
"Your “Show canceled tonight” graphic. Square or 4:5 pictures look best on "
"both. Without one, Facebook gets a text post with a link to your website."
msgstr ""
"Your “Show cancelled tonight” graphic. Square or 4:5 pictures look best on "
"both. Without one, Facebook gets a text post with a link to your website."

msgid "Canceled post"
msgstr "Cancelled post"

msgid ""
"Couldn’t find that place. Try “Town, State ZIP”, or paste a Google Maps link"
" to your house."
msgstr ""
"Couldn’t find that place. Try “Town, Province postal code”, or paste a "
"Google Maps link to your house."

msgid "ZIP code"
msgstr "Postal code"

msgid ""
"Big banner: show tonight, starting soon, canceled or off season. Updates by "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Big banner: show tonight, starting soon, cancelled or off season. Updates by"
" itself."

msgid ""
"Your Name in Lights, Make a Light Show (and the contest), coloring pages and"
" games."
msgstr ""
"Your Name in Lights, Make a Light Show (and the contest), colouring pages "
"and games."

msgid "This year’s show videos and favorite song voting."
msgstr "This year’s show videos and favourite song voting."

msgid "Coloring Pages"
msgstr "Colouring Pages"

msgid ""
"Pages to print and color (pick which ones under Artwork & Kids’ Corner)"
msgstr ""
"Pages to print and colour (pick which ones under Artwork & Kids’ Corner)"

msgid "Coloring pages, songs, pictures"
msgstr "Colouring pages, songs, pictures"

msgid "ZIP / postcode"
msgstr "Postal code"

msgid ""
"Text and Size: Automatic works for most screens. Small pixel matrices (64 "
"pixels tall or less) get one big line that scrolls across when the message "
"won’t fit; TVs and projectors get still text with the name on its own line. "
"Scrolling text always crosses the screen in the time each name is up; Slow "
"may not quite finish on long messages. Custom size: the font size FPP uses, "
"about how many pixels tall the letters are (a 10-pixel-tall matrix looks "
"good at 8 or 9). Still text goes on one, two or three centered lines (the "
"name on its own line after the comma), whichever lets the letters be biggest"
" without going over that size; scrolling text keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Text and Size: Automatic works for most screens. Small pixel matrices (64 "
"pixels tall or less) get one big line that scrolls across when the message "
"won’t fit; TVs and projectors get still text with the name on its own line. "
"Scrolling text always crosses the screen in the time each name is up; Slow "
"may not quite finish on long messages. Custom size: the font size FPP uses, "
"about how many pixels tall the letters are (a 10-pixel-tall matrix looks "
"good at 8 or 9). Still text goes on one, two or three centred lines (the "
"name on its own line after the comma), whichever lets the letters be biggest"
" without going over that size; scrolling text keeps it."

msgid ""
"Pictures, coloring pages and songs for the Kids’ Corner. All optional: "
"anything left empty uses the standard pictures."
msgstr ""
"Pictures, colouring pages and songs for the Kids’ Corner. All optional: "
"anything left empty uses the standard pictures."

msgid "Your logo is printed in the corner of every standard coloring page."
msgstr "Your logo is printed in the corner of every standard colouring page."

msgid ""
"Your show name is printed in the corner of every standard coloring page (or "
"your logo, once you add one in Website basics)."
msgstr ""
"Your show name is printed in the corner of every standard colouring page (or"
" your logo, once you add one in Website basics)."

msgid "Coloring pages that come with Marquee"
msgstr "Colouring pages that come with Marquee"

msgid ""
"Untick any you want off for now, or click Remove to take it out of this "
"list. If every page is off and you add none of your own, the Coloring Pages "
"door is hidden."
msgstr ""
"Untick any you want off for now, or click Remove to take it out of this "
"list. If every page is off and you add none of your own, the Colouring Pages"
" door is hidden."

msgid "More coloring pages"
msgstr "More colouring pages"

msgid "Header, app icon fallback, share previews and coloring pages."
msgstr "Header, app icon fallback, share previews and colouring pages."

msgid "What the banner says when the show is on, canceled or off season."
msgstr "What the banner says when the show is on, cancelled or off season."

msgid ""
"Type an idea, like “purple and gold Mardi Gras”, and click Add it. The AI "
"picks the colors and effects; add as many as you like, one at a time."
msgstr ""
"Type an idea, like “purple and gold Mardi Gras”, and click Add it. The AI "
"picks the colours and effects; add as many as you like, one at a time."

msgid ""
"A photo of your house during that sequence works great. No picture? Pick a "
"look and kids see a little animated house in those colors."
msgstr ""
"A photo of your house during that sequence works great. No picture? Pick a "
"look and kids see a little animated house in those colours."

msgid ""
"A small cover next to each song in Tonight’s Playlist and Vote for Your "
"Favorite Song. It uses the artwork you set in Remote Falcon, or your own "
"picture below."
msgstr ""
"A small cover next to each song in Tonight’s Playlist and Vote for Your "
"Favourite Song. It uses the artwork you set in Remote Falcon, or your own "
"picture below."

msgid "Show canceled"
msgstr "Show cancelled"

msgid "%1$s main effects changed, %2$s recolored"
msgstr "%1$s main effects changed, %2$s recoloured"

msgid "The theme needs at least one color."
msgstr "The theme needs at least one colour."

msgid "Box color"
msgstr "Box colour"

msgid "Sponsors box color"
msgstr "Sponsors box colour"

msgid ""
"Green sits nicely between the guestbook and the red Donate box. If Box "
"colors (Appearance → Customize → Look) is set to one color for every box, "
"that color is used here too."
msgstr ""
"Green sits nicely between the guestbook and the red Donate box. If Box "
"colours (Appearance → Customize → Look) is set to one colour for every box, "
"that colour is used here too."

msgid "For example: let visitors pick a color for their name on the matrix."
msgstr "For example: let visitors pick a colour for their name on the matrix."

msgid ""
