"numbers, fact cards and fan favorites (fill it in under Sharing & donations)"
msgstr ""
"A page about your show with its own button at the top: your photo and "
"numbers, fact cards and fan favourites (fill it in under Sharing & "
"donations)"

msgid "Fan Favorites by year"
msgstr "Fan Favourites by year"

msgid ""
"Your show photo and numbers, Did You Know? fact cards, and fan favorites by "
"year."
msgstr ""
"Your show photo and numbers, Did You Know? fact cards, and fan favourites by"
" year."

