msgid ""
"Our Story, Questions & Answers, a photo gallery… Start from a layout in your"
" show’s colors."
msgstr ""
"Our Story, Questions & Answers, a photo gallery… Start from a layout in your"
" show’s colours."

msgid ""
"Pick a layout to start from. It’s already in your show’s colors; change the "
