msgid ""
"Text and Size: Automatic works for most screens. Pixel matrices (up to 256 "
"pixels tall) get one big line that scrolls across when the message won’t "
"fit; TVs and projectors get still text with the name on its own line. Bigger"
" or smaller makes the letters bigger or smaller than that, but still text "
"never goes past the edges of the screen (for even bigger letters, use "
"Scrolling). Scrolling text always crosses the screen in the time each name "
"is up; Slow may not quite finish on long messages. Custom size: the font "
"size FPP uses, about how many pixels tall the letters are (a 10-pixel-tall "
"matrix looks good at 8 or 9). Still text goes on one, two or three centered "
"lines (the name on its own line after the comma), whichever lets the letters"
" be biggest without going over that size; scrolling text keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Text and Size: Automatic works for most screens. Pixel matrices (up to 256 "
"pixels tall) get one big line that scrolls across when the message won’t "
"fit; TVs and projectors get still text with the name on its own line. Bigger"
" or smaller makes the letters bigger or smaller than that, but still text "
"never goes past the edges of the screen (for even bigger letters, use "
"Scrolling). Scrolling text always crosses the screen in the time each name "
"is up; Slow may not quite finish on long messages. Custom size: the font "
"size FPP uses, about how many pixels tall the letters are (a 10-pixel-tall "
"matrix looks good at 8 or 9). Still text goes on one, two or three centred "
"lines (the name on its own line after the comma), whichever lets the letters"
" be biggest without going over that size; scrolling text keeps it."

msgid ""
"Your show’s location is only the middle of your ZIP code or town, so people "
"at your show may be told they’re too far away. Set the exact spot in Show "
"details → Location & weather."
msgstr ""
"Your show’s location is only the middle of your postal code or town, so "
"people at your show may be told they’re too far away. Set the exact spot in "
"Show details → Location & weather."

msgid ""
"This pin is the middle of your ZIP code or town, not your house. Weather and"
" sunset are fine, but directions and “Only at the show” need the exact spot."
" Type your full street address above and click Find. If your house still "
"isn’t found, paste a Google Maps link to it instead."
msgstr ""
"This pin is the middle of your postal code or town, not your house. Weather "
"and sunset are fine, but directions and “Only at the show” need the exact "
"spot. Type your full street address above and click Find. If your house "
"still isn’t found, paste a Google Maps link to it instead."
